 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "VIS10:30",
   "ptr": "0x30",
   "len": 46,
   "jp": "その時、クライツェン全土を微かな地震が襲った。",
   "en": "At that moment, a faint tremor struck all of Kreutzen.",
   "max": 46,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:5f",
   "ptr": "0x5f",
   "len": 46,
   "jp": "そして人々は聞いたのだ、黒竜のほうこうを・・・",
   "en": "And then the people heard it: the roar of the Black Dragon...",
   "max": 46,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:8e",
   "ptr": "0x8e",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "それは耳で聞いたのではなく、",
   "en": "It was not heard with the ears,",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:ab",
   "ptr": "0xab",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "直接、ひとりひとりの心へと響き渡った。",
   "en": "but rang out directly in the heart of each and every one.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:d2",
   "ptr": "0xd2",
   "len": 62,
   "jp": "魂が一瞬にして、黒い塊に飲み込まれてしまうような叫び声が・・・",
   "en": "A cry as if a black mass swallowed their souls in an instant...",
   "max": 62,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:111",
   "ptr": "0x111",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "戦士は剣を落とし、",
   "en": "Warriors dropped their swords,",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:124",
   "ptr": "0x124",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "神官は祈りを忘れ、",
   "en": "priests forgot their prayers,",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:137",
   "ptr": "0x137",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "子供たちは泣くのをやめた。",
   "en": "and children stopped crying.",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:152",
   "ptr": "0x152",
   "len": 52,
   "jp": "人々はすぐに、そのほうこうの主が誰なのかを理解した。",
   "en": "At once, the people understood whose roar it was.",
   "max": 52,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "mes",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "VIS10:187",
